Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 21:30:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(ui): report the same job buckets in the task list
 legend

The counters above the bar still used the three buckets the tasks
endpoint returns, so a task could read "1 done, 2 on review" next to a
bar drawn from five segments. Render both from one bucket list and give
the counters the segment colours.

Also push the bar below the counters: the wrapper pulls its first child
down by a grid unit to tuck the antd progress bar under the text, and a
plain div needs the matching top margin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UX8GBrH8Jb7eacj7Pj9hKi
